75f4d00": "金鱼|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "356a8fce": "虫子|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3795f7c9": "鸟窝|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5072d73c": "草地|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c7218a33": "黄色|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "76162dbb": "白云|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d2f4b1b9": "黑板|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "85e7c6a8": "绿叶|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "156f1853": "红绿灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3437fd33": "蓝天|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "23f9687b": "今天奶奶教我和弟弟画画，我们先画了一大片草地。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b84e02cc": "草地上面是蓝天，太阳暖暖的。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6e3f0e39": "天上的白云像一团一团的棉花。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "059d8e1e": "弟弟画了一辆马车，前面是一匹黑马。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9ee39398": "我画了一只山羊，它有两只弯弯的角。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f40f3b80": "奶奶说，小牛最爱喝牛奶。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "19399f36": "我们还画了一个鱼缸，里面有两条金鱼。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "426b499a": "大树上长满了绿叶。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ba7c575b": "树上有一个鸟窝，里面有三只小鸟。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "61f9d899": "一条小虫子在绿叶上慢慢地爬。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dfb47049": "太阳是什么颜色的？弟弟说要用黄色。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ccd67faa": "马路边的红绿灯上有红灯、黄灯和绿灯。红灯停，绿灯行。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "02c5dff3": "明天我要把这张画贴在教室的黑板旁边。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1fc5b24d": "今天我们一起画画，画什么好呢？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-22%|-12Hz", "47ae77ec": "我要画一匹黑马和一头黄牛！|zh-CN-YunxiaNeural|-10%", "27465ef0": "我画小羊，小羊是白色的。|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "233ba705": "草地要用绿色，天空要用蓝色。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-22%|-12Hz", "f478e899": "河里画几条小鱼，天上画一只小鸟。|zh-CN-YunxiaNeural|-10%", "14d47eb1": "花上还有一只小虫，我用红色画它。|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "7b22c854": "画得真好看！等妈妈回来，给她看看吧。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-22%|-12Hz", "4f2e0cec": "马路|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d03a49bf": "小牛|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "60295df2": "羊毛|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8ede6fb9": "鱼缸|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "905e6c88": "毛毛虫|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0c7fec33": "小鸟|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e2878915": "小草|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "af0412d8": "黄牛|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bdfbdc13": "白天|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-1